   </condition>
   <condition type="2">
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Accountable Entity must submit evidence, in form and substance satisfactory to MCC, that, as of the most recent reporting period, operators are substantially in compliance with their payment obligations to ARCEP (including regulatory fees and Universal Service Fund levies) and that ARCEP is engaged in a good faith effort to recover any outstanding amounts owed.</narrative>
